diff --git a/docs/sdk-index.md b/docs/sdk-index.md
index 0d3fbf694..02cde100d 100644
--- a/docs/sdk-index.md
+++ b/docs/sdk-index.md
@@ -1413,6 +1413,7 @@ Families:
 - `ManaRestriction.ClassLevelUpOnly` — "Spend this mana only to … gain a Class level." Satisfied only by paying the cost of a Class's level-up ability (CR 716.2c: "to gain a Class level" means to activate an ability indicated by a class…
 - `ManaRestriction.ColoredSpellsOnly(withoutXInCost: Boolean)` — "Spend this mana only to cast a spell that's one or more colors" — the complement of ColorlessSpellsOnly: a spell with at least one color (CR 105.2), read off the spell being cast, so a hybrid or d…
 - `ManaRestriction.ColorlessSpellsOnly` — "Spend this mana only to cast colorless spells." A spell is colorless when its colors are empty (CR 105.2c) — a devoid spell, an artifact with no colored symbols, and a face-down spell (CR 708.2) a…
+- `ManaRestriction.ColorlessSubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly(subtype: String)` — "Spend this mana only to cast colorless subtype spells or activate abilities of colorless subtype." Both the spell and the ability's SOURCE must be colorless.
 - `ManaRestriction.CostsContainingXOnly` — "Spend this mana only on costs that contain {X}." Satisfied by casting a spell whose mana cost contains {X}, and by activating an ability whose mana cost contains {X} — both are costs, so unlike Sp…
 - `ManaRestriction.CreatureSpellsOnly` — "Spend this mana only to cast creature spells."
 - `ManaRestriction.DisturbCostOnly` — "Spend this mana only to pay a disturb cost." Satisfied only by casting a spell for its disturb alternative cost (CR 702.146a — cast transformed from the graveyard).
diff --git a/mtg-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/sdk/scripting/effects/ManaRestriction.kt b/mtg-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/sdk/scripting/effects/ManaRestriction.kt
index bff352a19..06055b8c3 100644
--- a/mtg-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/sdk/scripting/effects/ManaRestriction.kt
+++ b/mtg-sdk/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/sdk/scripting/effects/ManaRestriction.kt
@@ -111,6 +111,22 @@ sealed interface ManaRestriction {
                 if (withoutXInCost) " without {X} in its mana cost" else ""
     }
 
+    /**
+     * "Spend this mana only to cast colorless [subtype] spells or activate abilities of
+     * colorless [subtype]." Both the spell and the ability's SOURCE must be colorless.
+     *
+     * This cannot be expressed by AllOf(ColorlessSpellsOnly,
+     * SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly): ColorlessSpellsOnly rejects every ability activation.
+     * Conversely SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly by itself accepts colored sources.
+     * Eldrazi Temple is the motivating card.
+     */
+    @SerialName("ColorlessSubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly")
+    @Serializable
+    data class ColorlessSubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly(val subtype: String) : ManaRestriction {
+        override val description: String =
+            "Spend this mana only to cast colorless $subtype spells or activate abilities of colorless $subtype"
+    }
+
     /**
      * "Spend this mana only on costs that contain {X}." Satisfied by casting a spell whose mana
      * cost contains {X}, and by activating an ability whose mana cost contains {X} — both are
diff --git a/mtg-sdk/src/test/resources/sdk-surface-baseline.txt b/mtg-sdk/src/test/resources/sdk-surface-baseline.txt
index d535ae55e..bf0eb74bc 100644
--- a/mtg-sdk/src/test/resources/sdk-surface-baseline.txt
+++ b/mtg-sdk/src/test/resources/sdk-surface-baseline.txt
@@ -1728,6 +1728,7 @@ LoyaltyDamageFloor — ReplacementEffect — Deification — LifeLossFloor, Prev
 ManaColorSet.ExceptChosenColor — ManaColorSet — Open the Omenpaths — ManaColorSet.Union, ManaColorSet.SourceChosenColor — Union only adds pools and has no subtraction; SourceChosenColor reads a color stored on the source permanent, while "any other color" reads the choice made earlier in the same resolution and removes it from a base pool
 ManaRestriction.CannotPayGenericCosts — ManaRestriction — Jegantha, the Wellspring — ManaRestriction.CannotCastSpellsFromHand, ManaRestriction.CannotCastSpellsOtherThan — every other restriction answers "may this payment spend the mana" through isSatisfiedBy; this one admits every payment and refuses a symbol (generic {N}/{X}, CR 107.4b), which no payment-context axis can express, and the negative pair are shipped data shapes about the spell being cast
 ManaRestriction.ClassLevelUpOnly — ManaRestriction — Sorcerer Class — ManaRestriction.EquipAbilityActivationOnly, ManaRestriction.AbilityActivationOnly — a Class level-up is one activated ability among the others its source's levels grant, so neither the any-ability atom nor a source type/subtype test can separate it; EquipAbilityActivationOnly is the same narrowing for a different spend context, and both are shipped data objects on the wire
+ManaRestriction.ColorlessSubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly — ManaRestriction — Eldrazi Temple — ManaRestriction.ColorlessSpellsOnly, ManaRestriction.SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly — ColorlessSpellsOnly rejects every ability activation; SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly permits colored Eldrazi abilities, so neither can constrain both subtype and colorlessness of a source while also admitting spells
 ManaRestriction.ForetellOnly — ManaRestriction — Karfell Harbinger — ManaRestriction.UnlockDoorOnly, ManaRestriction.TurnPermanentsFaceUpOnly — each whitelists one special action's payment and is a shipped data object on the wire, so none can take another action as an axis; foretelling is its own special action (CR 702.143b), and casting the foretold card later is a spell cast that SpellsWithKeywordOnly covers
 ManaRestriction.OfChosenType — ManaRestriction — The Ringhart Crest (Kolvori, God of Kinship) — ManaRestriction.SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly, ManaRestriction.SubtypeSpellsOnly — both carry a fixed subtype baked into the pool entry; "the chosen type" is unknown until the producing source is known, and a sentinel subtype string would collide with a printed one, so this is the unbound template the engine binds to SubtypeSpellsOrAbilitiesOnly as the mana is made (it subsumes the deleted AddAnyColorManaSpendOnChosenTypeEffect)
 ManaRestriction.SpellsWithKeywordOnly — ManaRestriction — Niko Defies Destiny — ManaRestriction.KickedSpellsOnly, ManaRestriction.SubtypeSpellsOnly — KickedSpellsOnly asks whether the kicker cost was paid, not whether the card has a keyword; SubtypeSpellsOnly reads type-line subtypes, and a keyword is not a subtype
diff --git a/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/mechanics/mana/AbilityPaymentContextBuilder.kt b/rules-engine/src/main/kotlin/com/wingedsheep/engine/mechanics/mana/AbilityPaymentContextBuilder.kt
